<title>HONG KONG: ITC Holdings interim net up 3.15 pct.</title>
<headline>ITC Holdings interim net up 3.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	17.0   vs 16.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 2.0    vs 1.0</p>
